<code>bafybeiflhd5aimv4xavauidbetge3v3uadbqfibu5lfo4b26yyieqvnvae</code>
(<a href="https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31286627/ipip-0548-test-fixtures.zip"><code>dir-with-tricky-filenames.car</code> in
ipip-0548-test-fixtures.zip</a>),
and the header returned for each file in it:</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>UnixFS file name</th>
<th>Response header</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>plain.txt</code></td>
